            "<p>From decomposition of waste</p>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "k6nxkvq",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "6. SOLAR ENERGY"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "xkmqqlz",
      "content": "• Solar constant ≈ 1.4 kW/m²."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "vbdaggh",
      "content": "• Solar cells convert sunlight into electricity."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ctmkuv1",
      "content": "• Based on photovoltaic effect."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "n0h0fji",
      "content": "• Clean and renewable source."
    },
    {
      "id": "sx7g03y",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "7. WIND ENERGY"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "0b3sx1q",
      "content": "• Uses wind turbines."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "9r2629s",
      "content": "• Wind farms installed in coastal/high wind areas."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "qa3cbu6",
      "content": "• Renewable and non-polluting."
    },
    {
      "id": "s6vz4ua",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "8. NUCLEAR ENERGY"
    },
    {
      "type": "pullQuote",
      "content": "Sun is the ultimate source of energy for almost all life processes and energy forms on Earth.",
      "id": "beu9hty"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "g0q90v9",
      "content": "• Energy obtained from nuclear fission."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "hnq7m4y",
      "content": "• Uranium-235 commonly used fuel."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "grr27tm",
      "content": "• Produces huge energy from small mass."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "2nlq5y7",
      "content": "• Controlled chain reaction in nuclear reactor."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "1a08c0n",
      "content": "• Radioactive waste disposal is major issue."
    },
    {
      "id": "xm2hl0k",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "9. ADVANTAGES & DISADVANTAGES (QUICK TABLE)"
    },
    {
